---
/** Control Hub: Turn Connectivity Into a Product You Control */
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Control Hub</p>
        <h1>Turn Connectivity Into a <em class="s">Product You Control</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Create custom plans for every device, bill every level of your reseller network, and map each plan to the right operator plan in real time. ControlHub is the control layer where connectivity becomes your product.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn--acc" href="#demo">Book Your Demo Now</a>
          <a class="btn btn--line" href="/contact-us/">Chat With Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dash mk" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="dash-win">
          <div class="dash-bar"><span>controlhub / plan catalog</span><span class="live">live</span></div>
          <div class="dash-body">
            <div class="kpi3">
              <div class="box"><small>Custom plans</small><b>24</b><em style="color:var(--muted)">6 device types</em></div>
              <div class="box"><small>Reseller levels</small><b>4</b><em style="color:var(--muted)">MSP to retail</em></div>
              <div class="box"><small>Auto step-ups</small><b>318</b><em class="up">this cycle</em></div>
            </div>
            <div class="box" style="padding:12px 0 4px">
              <div class="cat-row h"><span>Your plan</span><span>Billing</span><span>Runs on</span><span style="text-align:right">Sell</span></div>
              <div class="cat-row"><span><b>Watch 1 GB</b><small>Wearable</small></span><span class="st st--acc">prepaid</span><span class="m">Operator B</span><span class="pr">$8</span></div>
              <div class="cat-row"><span><b>Tracker 50 MB</b><small>Telematics</small></span><span class="st st--ok">postpaid</span><span class="m">Operator C</span><span class="pr">$1.90</span></div>
              <div class="cat-row"><span><b>Camera 10 GB</b><small>Camera</small></span><span class="st st--off">pay as you go</span><span class="m">Operator A</span><span class="pr">$14</span></div>
              <div class="cat-row"><span><b>Business 5 GB</b><small>Smartphone</small></span><span class="st st--ok">postpaid</span><span class="m">Operator A</span><span class="pr">$15</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-bar"><span>rule: step up <em>Watch 1 GB &rarr; Watch 2 GB</em> at 100% usage</span><span class="ok">active</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="toast"><i>&uarr;</i><div><b>Line stepped up</b><span>Watch 1 GB to 2 GB &middot; no overage</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
